edit('docs/plans/preset-gallery-improvements/PACKAGE_CONTRACT.md',lambda s:s.replace('Current 0.86.1 behavior:', 'Retained 0.86.1 behavior:',1)+'\n\n## 0.86.2 density and transaction extension\n\nRecipe format 6 appends nineteen typed image mapping/response/frame fields. Format 5 converts through explicit neutral UV/clamp defaults; scene schema stays 58. Local image frames are saved in world/metre space and rebased relative to the destination setup without moving its existing layers. Supported bitmap bytes, scalar interpretation, curves, image provenance, mesh/UV requirements and complete Paint are retained. Procedural graph portability requires an explicit linear 16-bit PNG snapshot; the editable producer is not claimed saved.\n\nPreflight checks required channels for logical layers and their Paint Areas, texture UVs only in UV mode, saved local-frame validity, Paint compatibility, paths and package integrity before staging. Ready Load includes its first calculation and display preparation in the import hold. Late failure cancels staged assets/owners/publication; success is one Undo/Redo, including after source package files become unavailable. Library package status is a file-only manifest hint; full payload verification remains part of Load. See [executed scope](DELIVERY_0862.md).\n')
edit('docs/plans/preset-gallery-improvements/INSTALLER_CONTRACT.md',lambda s:s.replace('# Installer contract — 0.86.1','# Installer contract — current 0.86.2',1).replace('The [current delivery](DELIVERY_0861.md)', 'The [previous compatibility delivery](DELIVERY_0861.md)',1)+'\n\n## 0.86.2 distribution\n\nThe [current delivery](DELIVERY_0862.md) contains only the newly qualified Max 2027 pair, its MZP and a single-host EXE. Older-host 0.86.1 receipts and installers retain their original labels. Product `Patterns/` filenames are closed and hash-pinned inside the immutable release. The empty final-artwork catalog is supported; QA images are excluded from the installer and supplied only with the demo. Installation, repair, interrupted upgrade, 0.86.1 upgrade, cancellation and unregister were exercised in disposable paths. Artist profiles, personal libraries, activation and running artist sessions were not changed.\n')
def ledger(s):
    a=s.index('**Current active goal:');b=s.index('**',a+2)+2
    s=s[:a]+'**Current delivery: 0.86.2 D01–D11 scoped qualification is complete; see the [delivery report](../preset-gallery-improvements/DELIVERY_0862.md). Unrelated roadmap work and knowledge activation remain paused.**'+s[b:]
    s=s.replace('## Current delivery\n\n**0.86.1**','## Current delivery\n\n**0.86.2** implements the D01–D11 image/mesh density, persistent field visualization, recipe recovery and UI follow-up. The [delivery report](../preset-gallery-improvements/DELIVERY_0862.md) pins the Max 2027 MZP, EXE, editable demo and qualification limits. No artist installation or Git push was performed.\n\n### Retained 0.86.1 compatibility delivery\n\n**0.86.1**',1)
    s=s.replace('## Planned density and recipe follow-up','## Delivered 0.86.2 density and recipe follow-up',1)
    a=s.index('The [gallery plan]',s.index('## Delivered 0.86.2'));b=s.index('\n\n| Task',a)
    s=s[:a]+'The [delivery report](../preset-gallery-improvements/DELIVERY_0862.md) and its qualification receipt own the exact current pair and limits. D04 follows the user’s 19 October steering: only three generated QA fixtures; final product artwork comes later from the user. The final source passed native, generated, Python, managed, installer and owned Max 2027 tests. Earlier failed candidates and their original identities remain in task evidence; they are not current acceptance.'+s[b:]
    for i in range(1,12):s=re.sub(r'(\| D'+f'{i:02}'+r' \| )(?:In progress|Planned)',r'\g<1>Complete',s)
    s=s.replace('| Task | Status | Planned work |','| Task | Status | Delivered scope |',1)
    return s
edit('docs/plans/improvement-program/PROGRESS.md',ledger)
